<p>Your yeti's fur acts like a shield, providing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">13%, 18%, 23%, 26%, 30%</acronym> cold resistance, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">13%, 15%, 17%, 18%, 20%</acronym> physical resistance and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 11, 16, 20, 25</acronym> magical save.</p>